          "message": {
            "text": "These client-UI tests are non-interactive by construction. Playwright uses bundled headless Chromium, while the review and scrubber child processes receive their own no-open controls; either child could otherwise invoke macOS's default-browser opener even though Playwright itself was headless. The focused file passes 2/2 without opening a window.",
            "markdown": "These client-UI tests are non-interactive by construction. Playwright uses bundled headless Chromium, while the review and scrubber child processes receive their own no-open controls; either child could otherwise invoke macOS's default-browser opener even though Playwright itself was headless. The focused file passes 2/2 without opening a window."
          },
